The twelve Microsoft Visual C++ runtime DLLs belong in this directory.
They are not redistributable under this project's license, so they are
not committed -- see tools/fetch-vcruntime.md for how to obtain them.

The directory itself must exist: Madeira.xcodeproj copies it as a bundle
resource, and xcodebuild fails the archive outright when it is missing.
Without the DLLs the app still builds and runs, but games built with
MSVC will not start.
